    {
      "id": "assistant_1784810700144",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "Thank you for confirming. I am calling about your pending DHL invoices. The reason for my call is that Mind Your Business Inc. has a total outstanding of INR 57,920 across 3 overdue invoices. May I know the reason for the delay so that I can note it correctly?",
