      "role": "customer",
      "text": "No, I'll make the payment tomorrow.",
      "timestamp": "2026-07-23T12:45:22.174Z",
      "status": "final"
    },
    {
      "id": "assistant_1784810722571",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "Thank you. I have noted that payment will be released by tomorrow. Please ensure it is made by then. You have two approved payment options: the DHL MyBill self-serve portal, or Virtual Account Number bank transfer. Thank you for your time, Mr Anthony Gressive. Have a good day, goodbye.",
